BT 1 0 0 1 0 102 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL -0.102 Tw (In many organizations, records such as incidents, HR cases and financial) Tj T* 0 Tw (requests hold sensitive data, and standard role-based Access Control) Tj T* -0.112143 Tw (Lists \(ACLs\) can only allow or deny access at the table or role level. They) Tj T* 0 Tw (cannot decide access based on the actual value stored in a record's field) Tj T* (\(for example, Department, Priority, Confidentiality or Assigned Group\).) Tj T* -0.038333 Tw (As a result, users may see records they should not see, or administrators) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.085833 Tw (must create many roles and duplicate rules, which is hard to manage and) Tj T* 0 Tw (prone to security gaps.) Tj T* ET
