BT 1 0 0 1 0 102 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL (Implement a Script-controlled ACL that evaluates a server-side script at) Tj T* (access time. The script reads the field value of the record being) Tj T* (accessed \(e.g., current.department, current.confidential\) and compares it) Tj T* (with the logged-in user's attributes \(role, group, department\). If the) Tj T* (condition is satisfied, the script returns true and access is granted;) Tj T* (otherwise it returns false and the record is restricted. The rule is applied) Tj T* (on read, write, create and delete operations, so record access is) Tj T* (controlled dynamically without creating extra roles.) Tj T* ET
