BT 1 0 0 1 0 74 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL (Access is decided dynamically at record level based on field values,) Tj T* (instead of only static roles. A single reusable script can replace many) Tj T* (role-based rules, giving fine-grained control with low maintenance.) Tj T* (Conditions can be changed easily by editing the script, and the approach) Tj T* (works together with existing role and condition checks for layered) Tj T* (security.) Tj T* ET
